ough the world!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390350/extras/b8bee4e2d3a2e33a6f255e820613b546.poster.avif?t=1748008096\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390350/extras/b8bee4e2d3a2e33a6f255e820613b546.webm?t=1748008096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390350/extras/b8bee4e2d3a2e33a6f255e820613b546.mp4?t=1748008096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Leave your own unique mark by spinning webs through the interconnected world. Stick webs to almost anything and use them to create your own paths.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390350/extras/3a0ce7442b7918896faaebfd6dd65fa9.poster.avif?t=1748008096\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390350/extras/3a0ce7442b7918896faaebfd6dd65fa9.webm?t=1748008096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390350/extras/3a0ce7442b7918896faaebfd6dd65fa9.mp4?t=1748008096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Make friends with bugs, and dance with them. Some bugs could use a little help from a friend and might even join your rescue effort in return!","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["Sbug Games"],"publishers":["Sbug Games"],"release_date":"9 Sep, 2021"}